二、归档内容的质量说明 / Archived content

在适用法律允许的范围内，维护者不就归档材料及自动语音识别（ASR）结果的准确性、
完整性或特定用途适用性作出保证。自动转录可能存在同音误识、专有名词偏差、断句或
时间戳误差，使用时应结合原视频核实。

To the extent permitted by applicable law, maintainers make no warranty as to
the accuracy, completeness, or fitness for a particular purpose of archived
content or automated ASR outputs. Automated transcripts may contain recognition,
punctuation, or timestamp errors and should be verified against original videos.

